{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/7c77ac88d6ac7d158ce1b7dbb9dc37b3.avif?t=1759540724\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALTO</strong> is a 2D boss-rush action game focused entirely on deadly duels. There are no filler stages\u2014only relentless encounters against unique and brutal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the timing to dash through enemy attacks and counter in the same instant. Every mistake is punished, but every attempt teaches you to survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Content</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page and trailer reflect <strong>early development</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release features <strong>a total of five bosses</strong>.<strong></strong><br><br>All footage and screenshots are from a <strong>work-in-progress build</strong> and will continue to improve before launch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure boss-rush experience: every fight is a highlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss patterns and phases that test your reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who enjoy challenging and rewarding action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>AI</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly all of the game\u2019s graphics\u2014including backgrounds, objects, and characters\u2014were pre-generated using AI tools, and then manually refined and edited by the developer for final use<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/6b59fa499551a4cffbdd29f93e045c44.poster.avif?t=1759540724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/6b59fa499551a4cffbdd29f93e045c44.webm?t=1759540724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/6b59fa499551a4cffbdd29f93e045c44.mp4?t=1759540724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964330?t=1759540724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/f708ba4ca91ad1037232010d49d14d3963617599/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759540724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/0925249261162581b966a7b3943adca6fe3e4e3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759540724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/0925249261162581b966a7b3943adca6fe3e4e3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759540724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/7c77ac88d6ac7d158ce1b7dbb9dc37b3.avif?t=1759540724\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALTO</strong> is a 2D boss-rush action game focused entirely on deadly duels. There are no filler stages\u2014only relentless encounters against unique and brutal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the timing to dash through enemy attacks and counter in the same instant. Every mistake is punished, but every attempt teaches you to survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Content</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page a